WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:04.670
In Sapporo, a Japanese reader
finds your app is still in English.

2
00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:09.230
Your agent ran gt init without
flags, and it waits for an answer.

3
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:14.020
General Translation lets
your agent set up i18n

4
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.590
with the prompt from Setup for Agents.

5
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:21.030
The prompt has your agent run
gt login, which you approve.

6
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:27.350
It runs gt init with a flag for every
question, so the command asks nothing.

7
00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:31.690
Then it wraps your page in the T
component, adds a LocaleSelector,

8
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:33.570
and runs gt translate.

9
00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.950
It builds the app and reports
what it actually verified.

10
00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:42.570
Your app opens in Spanish and French,
and in Japanese for the reader in Sapporo.
